      "value": "@{5b0775ee55c49e65e1c522ff|full_name}: That's counter to the documentation \"Putting the IKFollower script on an object that is a child of any other bone will result in odd behavior.\" from https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/vrc_ikfollower, but I've never tested this.\n\nAlthough, I've had issues with IK_Follower with particals using burst emissions only working once, which is the main reason why I use fixed joints.",
