      "value": "As of build 904, the following components are whitelisted on SDK2/SDK3 avatars, and in SDK3 worlds:\nAimConstraint\nLookAtConstraint\nParentConstraint\nPositionConstraint\nRotationConstraint\nScaleConstraint",
      "viewerReactions": null
